select 'bfc17c0d-df0d-505e-b2d4-44bd34cfc16b', l.id, 1,
  'La prophase : condensation et fuseau mitotique', 'Prophase: condensation and the mitotic spindle', 'Chromosomes bichromatidiens visibles, centrosomes aux pôles, enveloppe nucléaire dissoute.', 'Bichromatid chromosomes become visible, centrosomes at the poles, nuclear envelope dissolved.', 'https://kjlgrgdryimazczrcvgx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/lesson-media/biologie/division-cellulaire/Prophase.png', 'https://kjlgrgdryimazczrcvgx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/lesson-media/biologie/division-cellulaire/Prophase.png',
  'Lors de la prophase, l''ADN s''enroule fortement : les chromosomes bichromatidiens deviennent individualisés et visibles au microscope. Le centrosome se dédouble et migre vers les pôles, où s''organisent les microtubules du fuseau mitotique. L''enveloppe nucléaire et les nucléoles se dissolvent.', 'During prophase, DNA condenses tightly: the bichromatid chromosomes become individualized and visible under the microscope. The centrosome divides and migrates toward the poles, where the microtubules of the mitotic spindle organize. The nuclear envelope and nucleoli dissolve.', 'Structure de fibres qui sépare les chromosomes pendant la mitose ?', 'Which fiber structure separates the chromosomes during mitosis?',
  'Fuseau mitotique', 'Mitotic spindle', 'À la prophase, chaque chromosome est encore bichromatidien (2 chromatides reliées au centromère).', 'In prophase, each chromosome is still bichromatid (2 chromatids joined at the centromere).', 'La condensation des chromosomes se fait en prophase, pas en interphase.', 'Chromosome condensation occurs in prophase, not in interphase.'
from public.lessons l join public.chapters ch on ch.id = l.chapter_id join public.subjects s on s.id = ch.subject_id
where s.slug = 'biologie' and ch.slug = 'division-cellulaire' and l.slug = 'la-mitose'
